      "title": "Inventory and Order Records Support",
      "bullets": [
        "Updated inventory records from receiving paperwork, checked item descriptions against delivery documents, and flagged discrepancies for supervisor review.",
        "Prepared order packets, maintained filing records, and coordinated routine status updates with staff handling incoming deliveries and outgoing orders."
      ]
    }
  ],
